{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"jq -c '{source_id,title,summary} // {claim_id,source_id,text,evidence_excerpts}' verification/example_site/spaces/compilers/sources/records/*.json verification/example_site/spaces/compilers/claims/*.json\"","aggregated_output":"{\"source_id\":\"source-01-using-profile-information-to-assist-classic-code-optimizations--219edcf6f0cf\",\"title\":\"01-using-profile-information-to-assist-classic-code-optimizations\",\"summary\":\"Chang, Mahlke, and Hwu describe how execution profiles can guide classic C compiler optimizations by forming super-blocks around hot paths and applying familiar transformations within those regions. Their prototype reports average speedups of 1.15 over globally optimized code while controlling code expansion to an average factor of 1.07.\"}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-02-machine-learning-in-compiler-optimization--5fbaa9c3f69d\",\"title\":\"02-machine-learning-in-compiler-optimization\",\"summary\":\"Wang and O’Boyle survey machine-learning-based compilation as an evidence-driven way to automate compiler optimization decisions. The source explains feature engineering, training, deployment, model families, direct prediction, thread-coarsening examples, and practical limits around data quality, training cost, legality, and representativeness.\"}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-01-using-profile-information-to-assist-classic-code-optimizations--219edcf6f0cf\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-02-machine-learning-in-compiler-optimization--5fbaa9c3f69d\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-01-using-profile-information-to-assist-classic-code-optimizations--219edcf6f0cf\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-02-machine-learning-in-compiler-optimization--5fbaa9c3f69d\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-02-machine-learning-in-compiler-optimization--5fbaa9c3f69d\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-02-machine-learning-in-compiler-optimization--5fbaa9c3f69d\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-02-machine-learning-in-compiler-optimization--5fbaa9c3f69d\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-02-machine-learning-in-compiler-optimization--5fbaa9c3f69d\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-01-using-profile-information-to-assist-classic-code-optimizations--219edcf6f0cf\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-01-using-profile-information-to-assist-classic-code-optimizations--219edcf6f0cf\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-02-machine-learning-in-compiler-optimization--5fbaa9c3f69d\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-01-using-profile-information-to-assist-classic-code-optimizations--219edcf6f0cf\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-02-machine-learning-in-compiler-optimization--5fbaa9c3f69d\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-01-using-profile-information-to-assist-classic-code-optimizations--219edcf6f0cf\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-01-using-profile-information-to-assist-classic-code-optimizations--219edcf6f0cf\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-01-using-profile-information-to-assist-classic-code-optimizations--219edcf6f0cf\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-02-machine-learning-in-compiler-optimization--5fbaa9c3f69d\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-01-using-profile-information-to-assist-classic-code-optimizations--219edcf6f0cf\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-01-using-profile-information-to-assist-classic-code-optimizations--219edcf6f0cf\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-02-machine-learning-in-compiler-optimization--5fbaa9c3f69d\",\"title\":null,\"summary\":null}\n{\"source_id\":\"source-01-u